    "adaptations": [
      "C++ wrappers with the existing C ABI and noexcept declarations",
      "memcpy bit extraction and GCC clz builtins in place of musl internal helpers",
      "VFP rounding-sensitive double conversion of a signed 64-bit accumulator via two exact 32-bit conversions, avoiding fixed-rounding __aeabi_l2d",
